# Architecture

Package import rule: `got.api` → `got.application` → `got.domain`. Never import application/API from domain.

| Change | Put it in |
|--------|-----------|
| Node/edge/graph integrity | `got/domain/model`, `got/domain/ops` |
| Validate / propagate / analyze | `got/domain/reasoning` |
| Use-case orchestration, DTOs, OpenRouter | `got/application` |
| HTTP | `got/api` |

- Do not reimplement validator or propagator rules in routes.
- Do not add I/O to `got/domain/reasoning`.
- Prefer live packages over empty `got/infrastructure` and `got/domain/ports` unless the task wires a real adapter.
- Validation does not currently block propagation (`ValidateAndPropagateGraphUseCase`). Changing that is a behavior change; see `docs/decisions/0005-validation-does-not-block-propagation.md`.
- Details: `docs/architecture/components.md`, `docs/domain/invariants.md`.
